WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:05.098
"Ahh!" Terrell cried. Ghosts were everywhere!

2
00:00:05.099 --> 00:00:07.190
He quickly jumped behind a bush.

3
00:00:07.191 --> 00:00:11.099
"Help!" someone called. It was Sam.

4
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:14.936
He was surrounded by ghosts! He looked really scared.

5
00:00:14.937 --> 00:00:18.147
"I have to help him," Terrell thought.

6
00:00:18.148 --> 00:00:20.652
He took a deep breath.

7
00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:25.072
Then he ran toward the ghosts, shouting.

8
00:00:25.073 --> 00:00:27.110
One ghost slammed into a fence.

9
00:00:27.111 --> 00:00:30.218
A second one tripped, crashing into a garbage can.

10
00:00:30.219 --> 00:00:35.469
Two bumped into each other as they ran away.

11
00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:40.708
Terrell folded his arms. "Those ghosts aren't scary."

12
00:00:40.709 --> 00:00:42.874
*** Roxy was trying to stop the

13
00:00:42.875 --> 00:00:44.484
creatures. But there were too

14
00:00:44.485 --> 00:00:47.969
many! "Where are they coming from?" Roxy

15
00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:49.682
thought. One creature looked in a car.

16
00:00:49.683 --> 00:00:52.811
Then it got inside. Vroom!

17
00:00:52.812 --> 00:00:57.039
The car drove into a telephone pole. Bam!

18
00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:00.452
The creature jumped out, rubbing its head.

19
00:01:00.453 --> 00:01:04.007
The pole was leaning over.

20
00:01:04.008 --> 00:01:08.003
Roxy flew fast. She pushed the pole back up.

21
00:01:08.004 --> 00:01:12.341
Another car was about to crash into a house.

22
00:01:12.342 --> 00:01:15.158
Roxy swooped down and stopped the car.

23
00:01:15.159 --> 00:01:21.163
Creatures stumbled out of the car.

24
00:01:21.164 --> 00:01:26.197
"Hmm," Roxy said. "These creatures aren't attacking anyone.

25
00:01:26.198 --> 00:01:29.342
But they need to go back to where they came from!"

26
00:01:29.343 --> 00:01:33.795
More creatures ran out of the house. They looked around.

27
00:01:33.796 --> 00:01:36.648
"What are they looking for?" Roxy thought.

28
00:01:36.649 --> 00:01:40.094
Then she gasped. "Their friend!"

29
00:01:40.095 --> 00:01:42.132
She flew back inside.

30
00:01:42.133 --> 00:01:45.763
Elvis was hiding under a table. The box was nearby.

31
00:01:45.764 --> 00:01:49.617
"Help, Rocket Girl!" Elvis said.

32
00:01:49.618 --> 00:01:53.662
The box shook. The creature was trying to get out.

33
00:01:53.663 --> 00:01:57.923
"I think the creatures are looking for their friend."

34
00:01:57.924 --> 00:02:00.279
Roxy opened the box.

35
00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:02.700
The creature hopped out.

36
00:02:02.701 --> 00:02:07.861
It let out a loud squawk.

37
00:02:07.862 --> 00:02:10.909
Suddenly creatures packed the room.

38
00:02:10.910 --> 00:02:14.092
They surrounded the first one, squawking happily.

39
00:02:14.093 --> 00:02:18.839
They all hurried upstairs.

40
00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:25.769
Roxy followed them into the room.

41
00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:29.436
A glowing hole filled the wall.

42
00:02:29.437 --> 00:02:32.448
"A wormhole!" Roxy said.

43
00:02:32.449 --> 00:02:35.365
"The creatures are from a different world!

44
00:02:35.366 --> 00:02:38.642
They must have come here by accident."

45
00:02:38.643 --> 00:02:43.772
Roxy watched them jump through.

46
00:02:43.773 --> 00:02:46.065
Soon every creature was gone.

47
00:02:46.066 --> 00:02:47.864
The wormhole closed. Roxy

48
00:02:47.865 --> 00:02:53.870
let out a long breath. "Whew!" She

49
00:02:53.871 --> 00:02:57.954
went back downstairs. Elvis

50
00:02:57.955 --> 00:03:03.098
was sitting in a chair. "Metro City is crazy!" ***

51
00:03:03.099 --> 00:03:05.630
Terrell returned Sam to his parents.

52
00:03:05.631 --> 00:03:08.295
"Thank you!" Sam's mom said.

53
00:03:08.296 --> 00:03:11.610
Terrell smiled. "No problem!"

54
00:03:11.611 --> 00:03:15.557
Roxy grinned. "Nice work, Terrell!"

55
00:03:15.558 --> 00:03:18.604
Detective Smith arrived and got out of his car.

56
00:03:18.605 --> 00:03:21.453
"Hey, Detective!" Roxy said.

57
00:03:21.454 --> 00:03:24.302
"Are you here to help catch ghosts?"

58
00:03:24.303 --> 00:03:27.891
Detective Smith frowned. "Very funny.

59
00:03:27.892 --> 00:03:32.302
I forgot my notebook. Here it is!" He picked it up.

60
00:03:32.303 --> 00:03:34.370
"You should go home, Rocket Girl.

61
00:03:34.371 --> 00:03:37.852
There's nothing going on here."

62
00:03:37.853 --> 00:03:42.516
"Nope, nothing at all," Roxy said as Detective Smith drove off.

63
00:03:42.517 --> 00:03:45.939
Terrell laughed.

